{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_title", "source_sha256": "025e6d2b3eb3f8fcb878154861476601c54b77b3fef0c9b3ea8855b5041fccde", "ja": "夜ふかしはKAWAII！", "zh": "熬夜是KAWAII！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2d3d3dc54f52082d8c520592056441d4c9cf486814ff7683c9eb0c62ae5c60ff", "ja": "合同イベント前夜。春香、伊織、響は\n近くのホテルに泊まることになった。\nお菓子パーティーでリラックスしながら、\nライブに向けて気持ちを高めていく。\nそして翌朝……寝坊する春香だった。", "zh": "联合活动前夜。春香、伊织和响\n住进了附近的酒店。\n她们一边开着零食派对放松身心，\n一边为接下来的演出调整情绪、鼓足干劲。\n然而到了第二天早上……春香却睡过了头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1000_null", "source_sha256": "2b3b6b483a74e9ab919274dc0ee3e709b156133caae987f36a43bbf1084b661a", "ja": "―合同イベント　本番前夜―", "zh": "——联合活动 正式演出前夜——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "ec19781bd58798ba0bc2a157a6d1c130f501289dc10feffcf16f0f3a3145fcdd", "ja": "春香ー。\nお風呂空いたからいつでも入っていいわよ。", "zh": "春香——。\n浴室空出来了，你随时可以去洗哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "23791450be607f6db834ecb70e6025ce2d03b85f60de85b4e9549dbbadc854c7", "ja": "ありがとう！　でも、お菓子広げたところだから、\nもう少し後がいいかなっ。", "zh": "谢谢！不过我才刚把零食摊开，所以再晚一点比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "a1635731ee476b8502e31abadf7297b058efcfb2a0b6aa08db7e3329cf96d408", "ja": "あきれた。ホントにお菓子パするの？\n明日本番なんだから、ほどほどにしときなさいよねっ。", "zh": "真是的。你们真的要开零食派对吗？明天就是正式演出了，给我适可而止哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "9ec7d809b2dff10dd0cfa81ba571992732a1b945ca17f9d534e1de2089230a9c", "ja": "いっぱいレッスンしたから、なんくるないさ～。\nせっかくの前泊だし、満喫しなくちゃねっ！", "zh": "练了那么多次，总会有办法的啦～。\n难得能提前住一晚，不好好享受一下可不行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "a521240cece2233846929f78b4fa4042238c0d3b69270b98bbfd40fb1afc6fe1", "ja": "そうそう、こういう時はぜんぶ楽しまないと！\n伊織も食べるでしょ？　オレンジジュースもあるよ～？", "zh": "对对，这种时候就得把一切都享受一遍才行！  \n伊织也要吃吧？还有橙汁哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "045bcebf3b482328b8bba5ba717bfc8392e2218d35b594409317f0605fef2b84", "ja": "しょ、しょうがないわね……。\nフレッシュのがあるなら、付き合ってあげるわ。", "zh": "真、真拿你没办法……。\n既然有鲜榨果汁，那我就陪你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "fedfc1a12b38823001a3de2fac35915cd20d9ec11fa0bf43936823ca580dff93", "ja": "自分は劇場に泊まりたい！って言ったんだけどね。\n未来達が最近また合宿したみたいだし。", "zh": "我本来还说想住在剧场里呢。不过听说未来她们最近好像又去合宿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "163d2b315d4f54aef6a53416b2cb2a7a0d2313870b643aa3b986fb2dc09375eb", "ja": "1日だけだと手間の方がかかるんじゃない？\nそれに今回は、他の事務所との合同フェスだし。", "zh": "只是1天的话，不是会更麻烦吗？\n而且这次还是跟其他事务所一起办的联合音乐节呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "a800f99337560d0273b414a6b4daae2e39043d86b0d97731437ede1abe1ed885", "ja": "まぁ、そうだよね。劇場お泊り会は、\nこれからの楽しみにしておこうっと。", "zh": "也是呢。剧场过夜会，\n就留作之后的期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "fbe646e1437c2c71c9e050f4d5b5967d7d94ad7227982529f7e371a5c502e82f", "ja": "合宿はできなかったけど、練習はたくさんしたよね～。\nプロモーションのお仕事もいくつかあったし……。", "zh": "虽然没能合宿，但大家练得都很努力呢～。\n宣传工作也接到了好几项……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "44fd55544a7687fd9460793f2be60edfe1efb7ebb31fec1b69ef519d66311514", "ja": "自分もテレビでいっぱい宣伝してきたぞっ。\nお客さんも共演者もみんなビックリしてたけどね！", "zh": "我也在电视上宣传了好多次哦！观众和共演者全都吓了一跳呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "d077dc61ce1f68464ffe9d5056fe3a60364298246bb00affe54dca2918289770", "ja": "曲も衣装も振り付けも、とっても可愛いのを用意して\nもらったわね。……私がいる以上、当然だけど♪", "zh": "歌曲、服装、编舞，都给我们准备了超可爱的呢。……有我在，这当然是理所当然的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "b2f2db35bde760e53d54b730a987f6135b1c42de98c91b5a49ebd5f98c30dddd", "ja": "いつもと違う大きなイベントだから不安もあったけど\n……今はすっごく楽しみになってきたよね！", "zh": "虽然因为是不同于以往的大型活动而有过不安，\n不过……现在已经超级期待了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "cad40266fb296392f33bdff38b76758163bd12c5779d899c3c6bce6f70cc73e5", "ja": "明日は私達なりのカワイイを、みんなに届けよう♪\n2人とも、よろしくね！", "zh": "明天，把属于我们的可爱传递给大家吧♪  \n也请和这2个人好好相处哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "416679647977434095d00ed4d135cf80ae1790a1ae776adc20a322308a6b8f33", "ja": "もっちろん！", "zh": "那～当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "920fe66506ff1382164cef93bd07f2fb435e304f8b2e06f170e3abf7bedef147", "ja": "一緒に頑張りましょう♪", "zh": "一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1017_null", "source_sha256": "06272b7f481e462932928402fe0f12f2119475f7054d73eedde38807d87be0ff", "ja": "翌朝……", "zh": "第二天早上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "44a37c91cad16b07a3a35da645e2d14b6fb722f618b994033fce76c6c89e8567", "ja": "春香～、荷造りまだ終わらないの？\nもう集合時間だぞ～？", "zh": "春香——，行李还没收拾好吗？\n集合时间都快到了哦——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "6c8d77e278b9284385749e53b17e5fa97ec373c874d226f30db85ac00fe94232", "ja": "あああっ、ごめんっ！\n着替えは詰めたから、あとちょっとだけ待って～！", "zh": "啊啊啊，对不起！\n换洗衣服已经收好了，再等我一下下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "77a06002d229e2cc33d01c0ecf3a70939193c92924ddb5cc015ccc633c21a78e", "ja": "まったくもう。\nイベント当日に寝坊なんて、たいした度胸よね！", "zh": "真是的。\n活动当天居然睡过头，胆子可真不小呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "c0ba073f88eb234263ff5c30192550b383fd6ed49a1b7caca7d6de239a05d62f", "ja": "だって楽しみ過ぎて目がさえちゃって……ていうか\n起こしてよ～！　響ちゃんと伊織の、裏切者～！", "zh": "可是因为太期待了，兴奋得睡不着……话说回来，叫醒我嘛～！响、伊织，你们这两个叛徒～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "fba7ab2f2f49b6824ceaf2a6d3cc58c6aee5575b746921aa71c95b7cb47f0697", "ja": "よい……しょっと！　あ、締まった！\n二人ともお待たせ……っと、とと、きゃああああっ！", "zh": "嗨……咻！啊，关上了！\n让你们久等……等、等等，哇啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1023_se", "source_sha256": "2177caca56ab7e55f779ab529fac48e46eb29c7afb9a05bfcaea6ef9c63b674b", "ja": "どんがらがらがらがっしゃーーーん！！", "zh": "哐啷啷啷哐——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "b1c9c55e5d97e49eff0ebfbb9b5e2a9f57bb3f8c5936a77b39dcdfe8c679a9d0", "ja": "あいたたた……。", "zh": "好痛痛痛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "42f59a42aa808117055742819c8455d9ebaa638fe045d38600cb0d8d1d254c18", "ja": "若干いつもより派手だったぞ……。\n春香、大丈夫？", "zh": "刚才好像比平时更夸张了点……春香，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_001har_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "597e04df8e38d0b0f1fb6f791df56c1e6b09dc20f9be2b65acde7cf840cb1a6c", "ja": "本当にそそっかしいんだから。\n本番は気合い入れていくわよ♪", "zh": "真是冒冒失失的。\n正式演出时可要打起精神来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
